346 │   (`Product.ts`, `ProductType.ts`, `Order.ts`, `OrderItem.ts`, `Sale.ts`,
347 │   `SaleItem.ts`, `User.ts`, `Printer.ts`)
348 │ - Criar: `database/watermelon/database.ts` (instância `Database` +
